   "new": "the page figure is probably the number of SPADs spanned by the 520 active macro-pixels along the long axis; the other 8 may be monitor or margin SPADs [E] |\n| Pitch | 10.08 µm | 10.08 µm |\n| dToF pixel | 3×3 macro-pixels → **192 lines**; 6×6 (the 300 m mode) → about 96 lines [E] |",
   "why": "1,560 is a SPAD count (3 per macro-pixel), not a macro-pixel count. 6 x 6 (the 300 m mode) gives about 96 lines, not 192."
  },
