  {
   "id": "06_C5_C5a_C6-021",
   "finding": "report #39",
   "old": "the *output step* is only the numerical resolution of the reported value.",
   "new": "the *output step* is only the numerical resolution of the reported value.\n\n**AS-DT1 range details from the spec sheet** [P]. At 10 m, accuracy is +10/−25 mm (20 m mode) to +45/−55 mm (40 m mode) indoors and up to +100/−120 mm outdoors; precision is 5 mm indoors and 20–40 mm outdoors; the output step is 0.25 mm. The \"±5 mm\" in some press is the indoor precision. In its 40 m mode the sheet also tabulates outdoor figures out to 40 m, with the ambient level unstated.",
   "why": "Receives the spec-sheet accuracy, precision and outdoor figures from the Range cell."
  },
  {
