   "finding": "report #17",
   "old": "By this measure a Livox Mid-360 delivers about 300× the AS-DT1's points/s × $R^2$, and a Hesai AT128 or ATX automotive lidar about 10⁵×.",
   "new": "By this measure (§C3b table), a Livox Mid-360 delivers $3.2\\times10^{8}$ m²/s, about $3.2\\times10^{8}/(1.0\\times10^{6})\\approx300$ times the AS-DT1's ≈$1.0\\times10^{6}$ m²/s (8,640 pts/s at ≈11 m outdoors on a 10% target). A Hesai AT128 or ATX automotive lidar delivers $6.8\\times10^{10}$ to $2.0\\times10^{11}$ m²/s, $7\\times10^{4}$ to $2\\times10^{5}$ times the AS-DT1's.",
