   "new": "| 940 nm, 20 nm filter, ρ = 0.1 ($1.32\\times10^8$/s) | $1.46\\times10^7$/s | $1.32\\times10^8$ | $1.5\\times10^7$ | $7.8\\times10^5$ (**≈170×** lower) | $2.3\\times10^4$ |\n| 940 nm, 10 nm filter, ρ = 0.9 ($5.93\\times10^8$/s) | $6.59\\times10^7$/s | $5.93\\times10^8$ | $3.1\\times10^8$ | $7.2\\times10^7$ (8×) | $9.5\\times10^6$ (62×) |",
